:seed: renta-2025
@step Open the annual Modelo 100 work unit for the filing year.
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A
@step Supply a registry relation value during calculation.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work calculate --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A --casilla 0003=24000 --binding renta-certificado-trabajo-retenciones=2400 --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-anterior=0 --relation renta-modelo-123-retenciones-periodicas=450
@expect result.relation_overrides["renta-modelo-123-retenciones-periodicas"] == "450"
@expect exit_code == 0
